WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.399 --> 00:00:09.260
The world's oldest living thing is a patch
of Mediterranean sea-grass between Spain and

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:10.260
Cyprus.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:21.789
It is estimated to be 200,000 years old.

00:00:21.789 --> 00:00:28.910
Paul McCartney is the only musician who has
topped the charts as a solo artist, in a duo,

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:33.490
in a trio, in a quartet and in a quintet.

00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:40.280
Americans eat 500 million pounds of peanut
butter a year, enough to coat the floor of

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:42.480
the Grand Canyon +.

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:50.920
Manchester United is the most hated brand
in Britain and the 7th most hated in the world.

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:51.920
+

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:56.620
When we blush, our stomach lining goes red
too.

00:00:56.620 --> 00:01:04.720
90% of the bullets bought by the Ministry
of Defence are used for training purposes.

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:09.420
A lethal dose of caffeine is about 50 double
espressos.

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:17.510
A father hired other gamers to kill his son
in video games, so that he would stop playing

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:21.180
video games and get a life.

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:24.950
Crocodiles can climb trees.

00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:28.370
Some pigs suffer from mysophobia, the fear
of mud.

00:01:28.370 --> 00:01:38.560
A study in Texas invited people to taste wine
labeled France, California and Texas.

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:46.440
Nearly all the tasters ranked French as the
best, but in fact all three were the exact

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:49.170
same Texan wine.

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:53.760
President Obama's secret-service nickname
is 'Renegade'.

00:01:53.760 --> 00:02:00.619
Ronald Reagan's nickname was 'Rawhide', Bill
Clinton's was 'Eagle' and George W. Bush was

00:02:00.619 --> 00:02:04.090
known as 'Trailblazer'.

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:08.560
Red Bull was originally called Red Water Buffalo.

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:17.659
Every time he made a cup of coffee, Beethoven
counted out exactly 60 beans to make sure

00:02:17.659 --> 00:02:21.620
it was always exactly the same strength.

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:30.939
Areas of the Moon include the Ocean of Storms,
the Marsh of Decay and the Lake of Death.

00:02:30.939 --> 00:02:38.859
By law, buskers in Dublin must have a repertoire
of at least 20 songs.

00:02:38.859 --> 00:02:48.349
India has almost 155,000 post offices: more
than any country in the world and almost twice

00:02:48.349 --> 00:02:53.209
as many as China.

